# NOTICE

This plugin adapts code from the following open-source projects:

- **dsh-drag-and-drop** (https://github.com/omdsh-dev/dsh-drag-and-drop),
  BSD-3-Clause — path resolution (`locator.ts`), platform search
  (`platform-search.ts`), fingerprinting (`fingerprint.ts`), protocol types,
  drag overlay, path chooser, file:// URI parsing, and the locate RPC flow.

- **dsh-drop-to-path** (https://github.com/loudMore/dsh-drop-to-path),
  MIT — host import/copy route pattern, sendSession prototype patch pattern,
  image re-dispatch for mixed drops, chip rail DOM injection with
  MutationObserver rebuild.

- **dsh-side-chat-plus-plus** (https://github.com/anzhaohao/dsh-side-chat-plus-plus),
  MIT — build pipeline (scripts/build.mjs) and plugin bundle scaffolding.

- **Bootstrap Icons** (https://icons.getbootstrap.com), MIT — file-type icon
  glyphs vendored in src/client/icons.ts (filetype-pdf/doc/xls/ppt,
  file-earmark-zip/play/music/code/text/file).
